es and more architectural.\n\nGiven the scope, I should be strategic. Let me focus on the highest-impact, lowest-risk changes:\n\n1. **AppModule main executor** — this is likely the single biggest cause. Let me read it.\n\nLet me read app/src/main/java/eu/kanade/tachiyomi/di/AppModule.kt around 140-170.\n\nAlso read MigrationJobFactory and the MainActivity blocking.\n\nLet me look at those.", "time": {"start": 1791916579835, "end": 1791916582392}, "id": "prt_1368d1bfb001GC4di8G7jHHlCV", "sessionID": "ses_ec9cf465fffebOZ3QlKFLFfp4r", "messageID": "msg_1368d0900001agRfIejywQg4QV"}, {"type": "tool", "tool": "read", "callID": "call_00_k3nz5ze8b6bfiz8ufpseu23f", "state": {"status": "completed", "input": {"filePath": "/home/runner/hub-work/yomikai/code/app/src/main/java/eu/kanade/tachiyomi/di/AppModule.kt", "limit": 60, "offset": 130}, "output": "<path>/home/runner/hub-work/yomikai/code/app/src/main/java/eu/kanade/tachiyomi/di/AppModule.kt</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n130: \n131:         addSingletonFactory { NetworkHelper(app, get()) }\n132:         addSingletonFactory { JavaScriptEngine(app) }\n133: \n134:         addSingletonFactory<SourceManager> { AndroidSourceManager(app, get(), get()) }\n135:         addSingletonFactory { ExtensionManager(app) }\n136: \n137:         addSingletonFactory { DownloadProvider(app) }\n138:         addSingletonFactory { DownloadManager(app) }\n139:         addSingletonFactory { DownloadCache(app) }\n140: \n141:         addSingletonFactory { TrackerManager() }\n142:         addSingletonFactory { DelayedTrackingStore(app) }\n143: \n144:         addSingletonFactory { ImageSaver(app) }\n145: \n146:         addSingletonFactory { AndroidStorageFolderProvider(app) }\n147:         addSingletonFactory { LocalSourceFileSystem(get()) }\n148:         addSingletonFactory { LocalCoverManager(app, get()) }\n149:         addSingletonFactory { StorageManager(app, get()) }\n150: \n151:         // Asynchronously init expensive components for a faster cold start\n152:         ContextCompat.getMainExecutor(app).execute {\n153:             get<NetworkHelper>()\n154: \n155:             get<SourceManager>()\n156: \n157:             get<Database>()\n158: \n159:             get<DownloadManager>()\n160:         }\n161:     }\n162: }\n\n(End of file - total 162 lines)\n</content>", "metadata": {"preview": "\n        addSingletonFactory { NetworkHelper(app, get()) }\n        addSingletonFactory { JavaScriptEngine(app) }\n\n        addSingletonFactory<SourceManager> { AndroidSourceManager(app, get(), get()) }\n        addSingletonFactory { ExtensionManager(app) }\n\n        addSingletonFactory { DownloadProvider(app) }\n        addSingletonFactory { DownloadManager(app) }\n        addSingletonFactory { DownloadCache(app) }\n\n        addSingletonFactory { TrackerManager() }\n        addSingletonFactory { DelayedTrackingStore(app) }\n\n        addSingletonFactory { ImageSaver(app) }\n\n        addSingletonFactory { AndroidStorageFolderProvider(app) }\n        addSingletonFactory { LocalSourceFileSystem(get()) }\n        addSingletonFactory { LocalCoverManager(app, get()) }\n        addSingletonFactory { StorageManager(app, get()) }", "truncated": false, "loaded": [], "display": {"type": "file", "path": "/home/runner/hub-work/yomikai/code/app/src/main/java/eu/kanade/tachiyomi/di/AppModule.kt", "text": "\n        addSingletonFactory { NetworkHelper(app, get()) }\n        addSingletonFactory { JavaScriptEngine(app) }\n\n        addSingletonFactory<SourceManager> { AndroidSourceManager(app, get(), get()) }\n        addSingletonFactory { ExtensionManager(app) }\n\n        addSingletonFactory { DownloadProvider(app) }\n        addSingletonFactory { DownloadManager(app) }\n        addSingletonFactory { DownloadCache(app) }\n\n        addSingletonFactory { TrackerManager() }\n        addSingletonFactory { DelayedTrackingStore(app) }\n\n        addSingletonFactory { ImageSaver(app) }\n\n        addSingletonFactory { AndroidStorageFolderProvider(app) }\n        addSingletonFactory { LocalSourceFileSystem(get()) }\n        addSingletonFactory { LocalCoverManager(app, get()) }\n        addSingletonFactory { StorageManager(app, get()) }\n\n        // Asynchronously init expensive components for a faster cold start\n        ContextCompat.getMainExecutor(app).execute {\n            get<NetworkHelper>()\n\n            get<SourceManager>()\n\n            get<Database>()\n\n            get<DownloadManager>()\n        }\n    }\n}", "lineStart": 130, "lineEnd": 162, "totalLines": 162, "truncated": false}}, "title": "app/src/main/java/eu/kanade/tachiyomi/di/AppModule.kt", "time": {"start": 1791916582437, "end": 1791916582539}}, "id": "prt_1368d2607001794IAJfuF2MqOI", "sessionID": "ses_ec9cf465fffebOZ3QlKFLFfp4r", "messageID": "msg_1368d0900001agRfIejywQg4QV"}, {"type": "tool", "tool": "bash", "callID": "call_01_dokbvlqhhj8brnwg70r95cc6", "state": {"status": "completed", "input": {"command": "cd /home/runner/hub-work/yomikai/code && grep -rn \"getMainExecutor\\|MAIN_EXECUTOR\\|async.*Main\" app/src/main/java/eu/kanade/tachiyomi/di/AppModule.kt"}, "output": "152:        ContextCompat.getMainExecutor(app).execute {\n", "metadata": {"output": "152:        ContextCompat.getMainExecutor(app).execute {\n", "exit": 0, "truncated": false}, "title": "cd /home/runner/hub-work/yomikai/code && grep -rn \"getMainExecutor\\|MAIN_EXECUTOR\\|async.*Main\" app/src/main/java/eu/kanade/tachiyomi/di/AppModule.kt", "time": {"start": 1791916582477, "end": 1791916582497}}, "id": "prt_1368d2628001TayendI07r6WpC", "sessionID": "ses_ec9cf465fffebOZ3QlKFLFfp4r", "messageID": "msg_1368d0900001agRfIejywQg4QV"}, {"reason": "tool-calls", "snapshot": "192cc822868ba7841b5abf635bc5b9ebd779bb2b", "type": "step-finish", "tokens": {"total": 41810, "input": 1197, "output": 180, "reasoning": 241, "cache": {"write": 0, "read": 40192}}, "cost": 0, "id": "prt_1368d3488001Ldr2SxMAjIb6OJ", "sessionID": "ses_ec9cf465fffebOZ3QlKFLFfp4r", "messageID": "msg_1368d0900001agRfIejywQg4QV"}]}, {"info": {"parentID": "msg_136851e9f001vbQSM6Hp2bsA9j", "role": "assistant", "mode": "build", "agent": "build", "path": {"cwd": "/home/runner/hub-work/yomikai/code", "root": "/home/runner/hub-work/yomikai/code"}, "cost": 0, "tokens": {"total": 43199, "input": 847, "output": 150, "reasoning": 858, "cache": {"write": 0, "read": 41344}}, "modelID": "big-pickle", "providerID": "opencode", "time": {"created": 1791916587341, "completed": 1791916596814}, "finish": "tool-calls", "id": "msg_1368d394d001iZZbByMeyGhP98", "sessionID": "ses_ec9cf465fffebOZ3QlKFLFfp4r"}, "parts": [{"snapshot": "192cc822868ba7841b5abf635bc5b9ebd779bb2b", "type": "step-start", "id": "prt_1368d4a58001L6tRRYgOYSLYFS", "sessionID": "ses_ec9cf465fffebOZ3QlKFLFfp4r", "messageID": "msg_1368d394d001iZZbByMeyGhP98"}, {"type": "reasoning", "text": "This is a clear bug: \"Asynchronously init expensive components for a faster cold start\" but uses `getMainExecutor` → runs on main thread. It should use a background thread/executor. In upstream Mihon, this is:\n```kotlin\nGlobalScope.launch(Dispatchers.Default) {\n    get<NetworkHelper>()\n    get<SourceManager>()\n    get<Database>()\n    get<DownloadManager>()\n}\n```\nActually upstream uses `launchIO`. Let me check what's available in this codebase. The original Mihon AppModule:\n```kotlin\n// Asynchronously init expensive components for a faster cold start\nCoroutineScope(Dispatchers.Default).launch {\n    get<NetworkHelper>()\n    get<SourceManager>()\n    get<Database>()\n    get<DownloadManager>()\n}\n```\nHmm, but instantiating singletons off the main thread could be a problem if they touch main-thread-only APIs. NetworkHelper, SourceManager, Database, DownloadManager — these should be safe to construct on background. Upstream does exactly this. Let me change to a background dispatcher.\n\nBut careful: `Database` construction via SQLDelight driver — is it safe off main? Upstream does it off main. And `ExtensionManager(app)` is in the list? No, only in singleton factory, not eagerly created here. But `SourceManager` construction may trigger extension loading? `AndroidSourceManager(app, get(), get())`. Construction may load extensions. Hmm.\n\nActually the explore said ExtensionManager loads all extensions via runBlocking at ExtensionLoader.kt:166, triggered when constructed. And SourceManager construction may create ExtensionManager. If we construct SourceManager on a background thread, extension loading happens off-main — good.\n\nBut wait: `get<SourceManager>()` on a background thread constructs AndroidSourceManager which may call `ExtensionManager` which calls ExtensionLoader.loadAll(). That's heavy. Moving off-main is good.\n\nLet me check whether the codebase has a preferred dispatcher/scope. Let me grep for how other code does background init. The user's App.kt uses `Thread { ... }.start()` with MIN_PRIORITY. I'll follow that style to avoid coroutine dependency concerns.\n\nChange:\n```kotlin\n// Asynchronously init expensive components for a faster cold start.\n// Фоновой поток, а не getMainExecutor(): построение БД, NetworkHelper,\n// SourceManager (грузит все расширения) и DownloadManager на UI-потоке\n// подвешивало старт библиотеки.\nThread {\n    runCatching {\n        get<NetworkHelper>()\n        get<SourceManager>()\n        get<Database>()\n        get<DownloadManager>()\n    }.onFailure { logcat(LogPriority.WARN, it) { \"AppModule: фоновая инициализация не удалась\" } }\n}.apply { name = \"app-component-init\"; priority = Thread.MIN_PRIORITY }.start()\n```\n\nNeed imports: `logcat` and `logcat.LogPriority`. Let me check existing imports in AppModule.kt. Let me read the top.\n\nAlso there's a risk: `get<>` from Injekt is thread-safe? Injekt's lazy singletons generally use synchronized. Should be fine.\n\nBut another concern: dependencies constructed on background might be accessed on main simultaneously → Injekt handles synchronization.\n\nLet me read AppModule top for imports.\n\nActually, I'm now concerned about scope: the user aborted the release build and wants results. Let me make a coherent set of safe changes:\n\nA. Dictionary chunking — DONE.\nB. AppModule background init (clear bug fix).\nC. OcrScreenshotBuffer.init / OcrVocabulary.configure off main? The user's main complaint is UI load; these are relatively small. But OcrScreenshotBuffer.load() could read up to 200 entries JSON (could be hundreds of KB) and list images. Let me check load().\n\nLet me read load().\n\nGiven the number of things, let me be careful and targeted. Let me read AppModule imports and OcrScreenshotBuffer.load.", "time": {"start": 1791916591713, "end": 1791916596472}, "id": "prt_1368d4a610012vIr3LKCv4wgur", "sessionID": "ses_ec9cf465fffebOZ3QlKFLFfp4r", "messageID": "msg_1368d394d001iZZbByMeyGhP98"}, {"type": "tool", "tool": "read", "callID": "call_00_owkjnyq28wyg1rljqsf0ymyf", "state": {"status": "completed", "input": {"filePath": "/home/runner/hub-work/yomikai/code/app/src/main/java/eu/kanade/tachiyomi/di/AppModule.kt", "limit": 40}, "output": "<path>/home/runner/hub-work/yomikai/code/app/src/main/java/eu/kanade/tachiyomi/di/AppModule.kt</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: package eu.kanade.tachiyomi.di\n2: \n3: import android.app.Application\n4: import android.content.Context\n5: \n6: import androidx.core.content.ContextCompat\n7: import androidx.sqlite.driver.bundled.BundledSQLiteDriver\n8: import app.cash.sqldelight.db.SqlDriver\n9: import com.eygraber.sqldelight.androidx.driver.AndroidxSqliteConfiguration\n10: import com.eygraber.sqldelight.androidx.driver.AndroidxSqliteDatabaseType\n11: import com.eygraber.sqldelight.androidx.driver.AndroidxSqliteDriver\n12: import com.eygraber.sqldelight.androidx.driver.FileProvider\n13: import eu.kanade.domain.track.store.DelayedTrackingStore\n14: import eu.kanade.tachiyomi.data.cache.ChapterCache\n15: import eu.kanade.tachiyomi.data.cache.CoverCache\n16: import eu.kanade.tachiyomi.data.dow